WEBVTT

00:03.630 --> 00:04.950
Huh? A devil?

00:05.010 --> 00:08.790
Eh? Oh, hahaa... it's nothing.

00:08.970 --> 00:11.360
Tenko, what are you talking about?

00:12.670 --> 00:15.330
Last night, we had that little encounter, didn't we?

00:20.650 --> 00:21.980
Shinichi!

00:24.610 --> 00:26.440
Wooah! You scared me!

00:26.620 --> 00:28.440
Why're you coming from that way?

00:28.440 --> 00:30.620
I came from Kumiko's house today.

00:30.620 --> 00:32.200
What?! Are you serious?

00:32.480 --> 00:34.200
What, does that mean you stayed over?!

00:34.200 --> 00:35.360
Did you hear that, Mai?

00:35.360 --> 00:39.090
No, it's not like that. I just visited her house with Tenko.

00:39.250 --> 00:42.360
Oh, is that what it was... you had me going there.

00:43.640 --> 00:46.930
Oh! Yeah, Samatarou, have you heard the news?

00:46.930 --> 00:47.440
Hm?

00:48.440 --> 00:52.810
A boy and a girl in our class... attempted suicide.

00:52.810 --> 00:53.730
What?

00:53.930 --> 00:57.570
And they were the two that didn't come to school yesterday.

01:00.680 --> 01:03.680
So everyone had the same dream and showed up late?

01:03.680 --> 01:07.500
Not everyone, Obara and Irisawa are absent.

01:07.960 --> 01:13.610
I heard from Shinichi that yesterday everyone saw a devil and was late...

01:14.130 --> 01:18.340
You know, I feel like I used to have dreams like that up until awhile ago.

01:19.300 --> 01:24.180
A dream where a girl in red clothes beckons me to come over...

01:24.400 --> 01:25.960
It was so scary!

01:26.740 --> 01:31.110
Come to think of it, wasn't Kumiko wearing red on your date?

01:34.670 --> 01:35.910
Thanks for waiting.

01:37.670 --> 01:41.240
The girl in my dream looked JUST like Kumiko!

01:41.990 --> 01:45.330
Could it be...  That Tenko wasn't lying?

01:46.140 --> 01:49.080
Kumiko... might be a devil!

01:51.420 --> 01:52.170
Samatarou!

01:53.600 --> 01:57.070
Why couldn't I have believed Tenko?

01:57.670 --> 01:59.580
If something happens to Tenko...!

02:03.810 --> 02:07.180
What's really important to me isn't Kumiko, it's...

02:07.310 --> 02:09.180
TENKO!

02:29.710 --> 02:35.030
dare mo shiranai basho de

02:29.710 --> 02:35.030
In a place unknown to everyone

02:35.850 --> 02:40.710
asa ga umare hajimeru

02:35.850 --> 02:40.710
The dawn is being born

02:41.070 --> 02:47.150
hoshi inotta negai wo ima wa

02:41.070 --> 02:47.150
The wishes you made upon a star

02:47.150 --> 02:53.050
hikari wo naku shita no ue ni koborete iru

02:47.150 --> 02:53.050
Are spilling forth from where the light had vanished

02:53.350 --> 03:01.960
sotto sukuu tame ni te wo nobasu

02:53.350 --> 03:01.960
I softly extend my hand to rescue you

03:05.150 --> 03:08.280
boku no koe wa sekai wo koete

03:05.150 --> 03:08.280
And my voice envelops the entire world

03:08.300 --> 03:11.370
itsu ka kimi ni tadoritsuku darou

03:08.300 --> 03:11.370
Perhaps some day it will struggle its way to you

03:11.390 --> 03:14.300
toiki morashi yume ga oitemo

03:11.390 --> 03:14.300
Even if you must abandon your dreams, exhale deeply

03:14.550 --> 03:17.440
douka kesshite wasurenu you ni

03:14.550 --> 03:17.440
And you'll never really lose them

03:17.440 --> 03:20.520
boku no yubi ga subete ni fureru

03:17.440 --> 03:20.520
My fingers touch all of creation

03:20.520 --> 03:25.910
tobira akete haruka kanata e

03:20.520 --> 03:25.910
Open the door and escape to a distant place

03:44.510 --> 03:47.920
Kiss

03:54.530 --> 03:55.080
Tenko!

03:55.950 --> 03:57.640
What's wrong, Samatarou!?

03:57.640 --> 04:00.230
Shinichi, Ai! Tenko's...

04:00.850 --> 04:02.380
Tenko, Tenko!

04:04.670 --> 04:06.380
Samatarou! Over here!

04:07.070 --> 04:08.030
Tenko!

04:08.260 --> 04:09.240
Above you!

04:12.490 --> 04:14.820
I came to class with Kumiko.

04:15.370 --> 04:16.220
Hurry on up!

04:19.170 --> 04:21.000
Idiot! You're an idiot!

04:21.000 --> 04:22.300
How am I an idiot!?

04:22.940 --> 04:25.210
Samatarou, why are you crying?

04:25.620 --> 04:27.180
It's nothing.

04:34.010 --> 04:35.660
Sup guys!

04:37.170 --> 04:37.990
Good morning!

04:42.820 --> 04:45.960
Kamiyama, I have something important to tell you later.

04:46.460 --> 04:48.290
Can you come to the nurse's room?

04:48.770 --> 04:51.880
Okay. I have something important, too.

04:56.270 --> 04:58.260
Oh! It's a helicopter!

04:58.260 --> 05:00.090
HEY!!

05:00.090 --> 05:01.240
Is she a child?

05:02.930 --> 05:04.140
Everyone, please take your seats.

05:04.140 --> 05:05.280
I'll be taking attendance.

05:06.310 --> 05:07.020
Aoki.

05:07.020 --> 05:07.620
<i>Here.</i>

05:08.010 --> 05:08.970
Irisawa.

05:10.410 --> 05:10.870
Okano.

05:10.870 --> 05:11.420
<i>Here.</i>

05:11.990 --> 05:12.810
<i>Obara.</i>

05:13.750 --> 05:14.140
<i>Kato.</i>

05:14.140 --> 05:17.680
Tenko... I'm going to meet Kumiko later.

05:14.480 --> 05:14.780
<i>Here.</i>

05:14.800 --> 05:15.490
--Huh?

05:15.850 --> 05:16.400
<i>Kamata.</i>

05:16.490 --> 05:16.930
<i>Here.</i>

05:17.750 --> 05:18.440
<i>Kamiyama.</i>

05:18.640 --> 05:19.120
Here!

05:19.420 --> 05:19.950
<i>Tenko.</i>

05:19.950 --> 05:20.470
Here!

05:20.890 --> 05:21.550
<i>Satou.</i>

05:21.640 --> 05:22.210
<i>Here.</i>

05:21.910 --> 05:22.780
Why don't you go?

05:22.830 --> 05:23.420
Tanaka.

05:23.420 --> 05:24.820
Why are you telling me?

05:23.680 --> 05:24.270
<i>Yo!</i>

05:24.730 --> 05:25.620
<i>Tsuchiya.</i>

05:25.710 --> 05:26.600
Some reason or another...

05:25.740 --> 05:26.310
<i>Here.</i>

05:27.040 --> 05:32.090
Uhh... Err, Obara and Irisawa seem to be absent today, too.

05:51.520 --> 05:53.020
Thanks for coming.

05:54.210 --> 05:55.590
You said you had something important to say?

05:56.570 --> 05:58.240
Kamiyama, you can go first.

06:04.850 --> 06:07.090
I want... to break up.

06:09.080 --> 06:09.770
Why?

06:11.050 --> 06:12.810
I've started to worry about Tenko...

06:14.180 --> 06:15.720
Tenko...

06:16.310 --> 06:19.650
No matter what I do, I can't stop thinking about her.

06:21.050 --> 06:25.710
You told me earlier, "All you can think about is Tenko."

06:26.610 --> 06:29.740
That's why I tried to start thinking about you, but...

06:32.620 --> 06:35.390
Do you love Tenko?

06:36.440 --> 06:38.640
To be honest, I don't know.

06:39.100 --> 06:42.780
We've been together for so long that I can't tell if I have feelings for her like that.

06:43.170 --> 06:48.790
But, like this, with me going out with you, I think it's wrong!

06:49.050 --> 06:50.030
That's why...

06:54.380 --> 06:56.340
Let's break up. Please.

07:03.300 --> 07:06.130
I understand. I guess there's nothing I can do about it.

07:06.840 --> 07:10.000
Tenko is really lucky, with you thinking about her so much.

07:10.270 --> 07:13.180
Oh, no! It's not like that, but...

07:13.870 --> 07:15.560
What were you going to say, Kumiko?

07:16.950 --> 07:21.350
It's kind of rude, but... I want you to save me.

07:21.870 --> 07:22.740
Save you?

07:23.360 --> 07:30.500
I want you, the Son of God, Kamiyama Samatarou, to save me, the daughter of a devil, Komori Kumiko.

07:33.490 --> 07:37.310
SHE FOUND OUT THAT I'M THE SON OF GOD!!!

07:38.070 --> 07:40.670
AND AFTER ALL, YOU'RE THE DAUGHTER OF A DEVIL?

07:40.790 --> 07:41.480
Yes.

07:42.390 --> 07:46.650
My mother is a devil. And I'm her daughter...

07:47.220 --> 07:48.610
So I'm a devil as well.

07:49.180 --> 07:56.140
I lived a normal life until middle school, but recently, I've started to take after my mother.

07:57.170 --> 08:02.770
Kumiko, consuming the lives of others is making me get better.

08:05.270 --> 08:09.500
From that day, my mother has been suddenly aging.

08:10.320 --> 08:13.960
My beloved mother has been getting older and older.

08:14.690 --> 08:18.350
It's like my mother is becoming a different person. I was so scared.

08:19.490 --> 08:27.020
I asked her what I needed to do, and she told me that it didn't matter who it was, but to enter someone's dreams.

08:29.990 --> 08:36.120
When I use a spell of beckoning in people's dreams, those with weak spirits come to me.

08:36.540 --> 08:39.670
And then I take their souls from inside their dreams.

08:40.420 --> 08:43.900
Souls aren't something light and fluffy, you know.

08:44.590 --> 08:47.900
They take the forms of whatever is most important to that person.

08:54.170 --> 08:56.570
With the scythe I received from my mother...

08:57.190 --> 09:00.510
I've reaped many souls from this world.

09:04.240 --> 09:09.860
When my mother consumed those souls... she returned to normal.

09:11.400 --> 09:15.290
If I do this, my mother will always be well.

09:16.250 --> 09:17.250
That's...

09:19.270 --> 09:20.500
What I thought.

09:21.600 --> 09:23.500
And then what?

09:23.680 --> 09:30.220
I started to dislike doing that more and more,  and thought that even though I love my mother, I can't do something terrible like this!

09:30.730 --> 09:31.980
And then, my mother said...

09:32.650 --> 09:40.400
"Then, bring Kamiyama's soul as your last one.  And then this'll be over with."

09:40.810 --> 09:42.100
My soul?!

09:42.760 --> 09:46.120
The Son of God training in the human world.

09:46.690 --> 09:52.270
With a soul like that, she said there'd be no need for human souls.

09:52.270 --> 09:54.540
Then, you approached me because...

09:55.320 --> 10:00.690
But, I started to grow to love you!

10:00.690 --> 10:01.950
What?!

10:13.500 --> 10:18.240
Now there's a plane! HEY! WHEE!

10:17.470 --> 10:21.690
But, I started to grow to love you!

10:23.950 --> 10:29.050
When you struggled so desperately to return my world back to normal...

10:29.050 --> 10:32.930
And you brought back the precious thing that had disappeared from me.

10:33.320 --> 10:37.140
I thought, "he's an incredible person, I've got no chance with him..."

10:37.750 --> 10:41.040
That's when I pretended to move, and stayed here, hiding.

10:41.690 --> 10:45.730
I told my mother, too, that I couldn't take your soul.

10:46.470 --> 10:49.090
But... she told me to try once again.

10:49.370 --> 10:52.080
And is that when you suddenly asked to go out with me?

10:52.260 --> 10:55.430
Yes. At first, it was all planned.

10:56.100 --> 11:00.410
But then, I really fell in love with you.

11:01.320 --> 11:05.670
I had fun on our dates, and my heart pounded so hard when we held hands.

11:06.710 --> 11:10.910
But... I guess I've been dumped. I guess that's it.

11:11.460 --> 11:15.970
Last night, when I came to take two of our classmates' souls...

11:16.480 --> 11:22.680
I thought "I can't do something like this!", and then I wasn't able to take their souls.

11:25.320 --> 11:26.680
I failed.

11:27.340 --> 11:30.060
After that, Tenko found me.

11:32.700 --> 11:35.590
Kumiko, you're not a devil... are you?

11:36.780 --> 11:41.170
Yes, it's as you say. I'm a devil.

11:41.910 --> 11:45.830
But, Tenko, I'll tell Kamiyama.

11:46.280 --> 11:48.570
Until then, can you keep it a secret?

11:49.740 --> 11:50.270
Sure.

11:51.380 --> 11:55.420
I'm sorry for asking you this at such an important time...

11:55.790 --> 11:57.170
What's so serious?

11:57.580 --> 12:01.440
But, Tenko's... returning to Heaven, right?

12:02.070 --> 12:03.790
Asking you this at a time like that...

12:04.570 --> 12:05.790
What did you just say?

12:06.560 --> 12:11.250
Had you not heard yet? That Tenko is returning to Heaven?

12:11.580 --> 12:14.590
That idiot... She really is an idiot.

12:16.580 --> 12:17.290
Kumiko...

12:17.550 --> 12:18.220
Yes?

12:18.650 --> 12:22.530
I, Kamiyama Samatarou, am going to... PUSH YOU DOWN!

12:25.010 --> 12:27.900
Kumiko... you know you shouldn't do that!

12:27.900 --> 12:30.250
A devil going over to that side...

12:30.250 --> 12:31.290
Mother!

12:31.290 --> 12:35.150
Mother? But I thought your mom was...

12:36.070 --> 12:39.890
Yes!  I was the one who gave that nightmare to all of your class.

12:40.150 --> 12:43.360
And then, I was rejuvenated!

12:43.770 --> 12:48.650
The souls were pretty bland individually, but with that many nightmares, it was amazing nourishment!

12:48.710 --> 12:54.880
And the your classmates' suicide attempts served as a nice snack, as well!

12:54.880 --> 12:59.520
With that power, I destroyed the toy factory!

12:59.660 --> 13:04.460
And then you were out of power... that's why you were sleeping all of yesterday morning!

13:05.290 --> 13:08.640
I don't age when I use my power...

13:08.970 --> 13:14.130
That was all staged so that you'd become a splendid devil!

13:15.000 --> 13:17.540
Kumiko, it's because you're so soft-hearted.

13:17.970 --> 13:22.560
I thought that if I pretended to be weak, you'd become a devil whether you liked it or not, but...

13:23.050 --> 13:26.690
Begging a god? What are you, a priestess?

13:27.420 --> 13:30.860
That's terrible of you...  You've been deceiving me all this time?

13:33.800 --> 13:35.670
Sorry about that!

13:35.900 --> 13:37.850
But you know, I'm a devil!

13:38.250 --> 13:42.160
Kumiko, you're a failure as a daughter and a devil.

13:42.620 --> 13:46.400
I thought you'd be able to easily get the soul of a god...

13:46.850 --> 13:49.530
But I guess I'll have to make a meal of him myself.

13:50.340 --> 13:53.680
You're going to oppose me? Some powerless kid?

13:54.150 --> 13:54.730
Get out of here.

13:55.080 --> 13:56.710
Oh, now you're acting.

14:00.180 --> 14:02.460
How cute, boy!

14:02.460 --> 14:03.740
Kamiyama, run away!

14:04.040 --> 14:04.900
It's okay.

14:05.300 --> 14:09.450
I'm the Son of God. Saving people is my job... I think.

14:09.450 --> 14:12.250
AHH! I HATE THINGS LIKE THAT!

14:12.660 --> 14:16.010
ANNOYING! GROSS! THEY MAKE ME SICK!

14:16.010 --> 14:18.690
So... die.

14:23.250 --> 14:26.460
Ow.... That really hurt.

14:26.700 --> 14:30.770
This scythe is made from human pain and sorrow!

14:31.030 --> 14:36.540
Even against a unique being like you, one good cut with this and you'll be butchered and fit for eating.

14:37.490 --> 14:38.610
Is that so...?

14:40.640 --> 14:41.290
Well then!

14:41.740 --> 14:42.470
Later!

14:43.140 --> 14:44.890
Er, WAIT! You won't escape me!

14:47.450 --> 14:49.160
Danger, danger!

14:49.730 --> 14:51.640
Your footwork is good.

14:52.110 --> 14:55.380
But how far do you think you can get when Kumiko's with you?

14:58.040 --> 14:58.810
Samatarou!

15:00.440 --> 15:01.410
What are you guys doing?

15:01.700 --> 15:03.120
Tenko!

15:04.440 --> 15:06.410
Did you enjoy our little meeting before?

15:06.410 --> 15:08.260
AHH! YOU'RE FUMIKO!

15:09.950 --> 15:10.820
Run, Tenko!

15:11.510 --> 15:17.260
Kamiyama. How about I give you a taste of what it's like to lose someone you love?

15:18.060 --> 15:20.010
I-I don't love her!

15:21.980 --> 15:24.480
I-I-I don't love you either!

15:24.740 --> 15:26.250
Bye now!

15:28.020 --> 15:29.360
Wait!  Fu!

15:35.430 --> 15:37.510
Holy... What is this?

15:42.340 --> 15:44.380
Don't come this way, run over that way!

15:44.480 --> 15:45.900
But I'm scared!

15:46.200 --> 15:48.110
That voice was Su, wasn't it?!

15:49.740 --> 15:52.300
Your movements are beautiful as always.

15:53.200 --> 15:54.580
It's speaking normally...

15:54.540 --> 15:56.000
The piggy bank?

15:56.000 --> 15:57.060
My name is Suguru!

15:58.260 --> 15:59.800
It's been a while, Fu.

16:00.040 --> 16:03.860
About a hundred years, huh? When did you become a pig?

16:06.260 --> 16:07.460
There's nothing I can do about it.

16:07.620 --> 16:10.610
Since Su showed up, I'll have to give up for now.

16:11.020 --> 16:16.830
But Kamiyama, Tenko. Next time I see you, I'll kill you.

16:17.050 --> 16:18.920
Oh, have a souvenir.

16:28.130 --> 16:28.800
Tenko!

16:34.930 --> 16:39.020
Heh... I'm fine, I was just grazed.

16:43.660 --> 16:45.890
I'm sorry... This is all my fault.

16:47.660 --> 16:49.470
Either way, we need to take Tenko to the house.

16:49.890 --> 16:51.990
Pig, Kumiko, help me out.

16:51.990 --> 16:52.600
Oink...

16:57.330 --> 17:00.060
Jeez... Samatarou, you're overreacting.

17:00.280 --> 17:01.890
Something like this is normal...

17:02.150 --> 17:03.750
This isn't normal at all.

17:04.140 --> 17:05.990
You can't go to the doctor to get something like this fixed.

17:06.480 --> 17:07.560
We're going home.

17:07.840 --> 17:09.650
I'm fine. I'd just be causing you more trouble.

17:09.650 --> 17:12.350
Be quiet. We're going to your home.

17:12.920 --> 17:16.230
My... home?

17:33.240 --> 17:39.180
CHOROMI....  CHOROMI....

17:42.190 --> 17:44.560
Tenko! What happened to your arm?!

17:44.560 --> 17:46.350
Huh?! What does this mean?

17:46.780 --> 17:48.160
What is this, Choromi?!

17:48.240 --> 17:48.790
Yes?

17:49.090 --> 17:53.770
Misa, Meme, we have a guest, so get out some extra slippers!

17:53.910 --> 17:55.500
Mom, sorry.

17:55.980 --> 17:57.790
It's kind of serious right now, so get out of the way.

17:57.790 --> 17:58.360
Okay.

18:10.620 --> 18:13.200
This looks pretty bad... Are you okay?

18:13.810 --> 18:15.980
Yeah. Don't worry.

18:17.020 --> 18:19.010
I'm sorry. This is my fault...

18:19.760 --> 18:23.810
What's all this? You're talking like I'm going to die. Idiot.

18:23.810 --> 18:26.530
You're the idiot! Why didn't you run away?

18:27.630 --> 18:32.020
Because... I just wanted to be close to you.

18:43.680 --> 18:47.260
Tenko. I... broke up with Kumiko.

18:47.910 --> 18:48.460
What?

18:49.070 --> 18:55.630
When I tried to figure out who was most important to me... my head was filled with thoughts of nothing but you.

18:56.650 --> 18:58.640
T-this doesn't mean I'm in love with you!

18:58.720 --> 19:01.930
I was just thinking about that when I broke up with Kumiko!

19:02.850 --> 19:05.040
Oh... I see...

19:18.640 --> 19:20.460
Tenko, don't die!

19:20.460 --> 19:22.360
DON'T DIE! TEN--!

19:23.110 --> 19:24.390
She won't die.

19:24.530 --> 19:26.030
Why are you a nurse...

19:26.640 --> 19:28.550
A angel doesn't die because of something like this.

19:29.140 --> 19:32.350
Life is a pretty stubborn thing.

19:32.740 --> 19:35.100
Mom... can she be saved?

19:35.380 --> 19:40.060
Uh huh! Mama's job as a nurse is to save her!

19:40.440 --> 19:41.720
That's why I'm asking you to leave, please.

19:45.480 --> 19:47.310
Will you heal her with your goddess' breath?

19:47.800 --> 19:49.530
I'll heal her with motherly love.

19:50.070 --> 19:54.460
Okay! Now commencing the "what will we do about Kumiko" meeting!

19:54.650 --> 19:57.030
The situation is just as Kumiko has told us.

19:57.470 --> 20:00.930
We need to protect Kumiko from that devil, somehow.

20:01.230 --> 20:03.750
Wouldn't getting Dad to save her be the best choice?

20:03.890 --> 20:04.500
No.

20:06.680 --> 20:09.340
The door to Heaven was gone.

20:07.710 --> 20:09.120
No opening the door to Heaven!
--Papa

20:09.690 --> 20:10.760
Are you serious?

20:12.690 --> 20:14.750
Dad, Dad!

20:19.140 --> 20:20.580
No good. I can't reach him.

20:21.230 --> 20:24.360
My mother is probably interfering.

20:25.400 --> 20:27.410
I'm sorry. This is all my fault.

20:27.870 --> 20:31.860
I'm causing you so much trouble, and now Tenko is hurt...

20:32.370 --> 20:34.170
I'm really sorry!

20:39.480 --> 20:40.920
Choromi, kneel right there.

20:42.590 --> 20:45.920
10, 9, 8, 7, 6, 5!

20:48.010 --> 20:48.930
Listen up, Choromi.

20:49.480 --> 20:52.120
I HATE girls that approach Samatarou.

20:52.930 --> 20:57.510
But if you're really in trouble, there's no way we won't save you, right?

20:58.320 --> 20:58.950
But...

20:59.070 --> 21:00.110
SHUT UP, CHOROMI!

21:00.860 --> 21:02.530
This is a house of gods.

21:03.050 --> 21:05.230
No matter who comes in here, if they ask us for help, we'll save them.

21:06.630 --> 21:07.400
Got it?

21:12.670 --> 21:13.240
Yes...

21:35.020 --> 21:36.260
Samatarou...

21:36.710 --> 21:37.640
Are you okay?

21:39.450 --> 21:40.770
Don't be so nice to me.

21:42.300 --> 21:43.520
It'll just be more painful.

21:43.700 --> 21:44.330
What will?

21:45.750 --> 21:48.170
I'm going back to Heaven...

21:48.780 --> 21:50.360
Kumiko told me.

21:50.930 --> 21:53.130
That's why you're being so nice to me, right?

21:54.470 --> 21:56.660
You don't really have any use for me.

21:58.410 --> 22:00.750
Tenko, it's fine. Go to sleep.

22:01.620 --> 22:07.940
Even if you don't love me, if just told me you needed me...

22:11.320 --> 22:13.900
If you told me you loved me...

22:40.300 --> 22:45.790
aru asa totsuzen (uh huh) sekai ga kawattete (kawattete)

22:40.300 --> 22:45.790
The world suddenly changed one morning

22:46.660 --> 22:52.250
kaeri no tochuu de (uh huh) kimi ni kissu sareru no (sareru no)

22:46.660 --> 22:52.250
While we were on the way home, you unexpectedly kissed me

22:52.660 --> 22:56.640
sonna no aru wake nai ka

22:52.660 --> 22:56.640
I doubt something like that would ever happen though

22:59.500 --> 23:04.240
dakara atashi kara ippo fumidasu kedo

22:59.500 --> 23:04.240
That's why my shoulders sank when you stepped away from me

23:05.750 --> 23:10.940
suki na taipu kiite kata wo otoshita

23:05.750 --> 23:10.940
And told me about the kinda girls you like

23:11.180 --> 23:17.530
atama ni doonatsu wo nosete mitemo

23:11.180 --> 23:17.530
Even if you put a doughnut over your head

23:18.410 --> 23:24.650
kore dake ja tenshi ni mienai (nainai kana)

23:18.410 --> 23:24.650
It wouldn't be enough to make you look like an angel!

23:25.920 --> 23:31.870
o~o kamisama onegai (kamisama onegai) kiru sugita maegami

23:25.920 --> 23:31.870
Oh please, God! Allow the bangs I cut too short

23:31.870 --> 23:37.600
sugu modoshitai nanto ka shiteyo

23:31.870 --> 23:37.600
To grow back quickly! You can do it somehow

23:37.630 --> 23:39.480
kotaenasai

23:37.630 --> 23:39.480
Please answer my prayer!

23:39.510 --> 23:47.290
sore ja naykkya ano wanpiisu ga niaeba

23:39.510 --> 23:47.290
Or at least let that one piece look good on me

23:47.330 --> 23:52.460
subete wa umaku iku yo, tabun

23:47.330 --> 23:52.460
Then everything will turn out okay... probably!

24:03.990 --> 24:06.400
Get off the ground and answer me, Mom!

24:06.550 --> 24:07.750
Why, Mother?

24:08.290 --> 24:09.590
Will it all be okay if I just come back?

24:09.860 --> 24:12.300
Samatarou, please save Kumiko!

24:12.580 --> 24:14.310
I'll kill the god.

24:14.310 --> 24:16.100
Go home, Tenko, please!

24:16.180 --> 24:19.610
I won't go back! I'll never forget your feelings, Samatarou!

24:20.470 --> 24:25.590
Next time on the final episode of Kamisama Kazoku: Angels' Prayers. Bonds that Connect.

24:25.850 --> 24:27.900
My weapon is... PERSUASION!
